<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) --></div><div class="page-wrapper"><div data-animation="default" data-collapse="medium" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar w-nav"><div class="padding-global"><div class="navbar_inner"><a href="#" class="navbar_logo-link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66c6e2433b7355a74b93c721_support%403x.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 707.998046875px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66c6e2433b7355a74b93c721_support%403x-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66c6e2433b7355a74b93c721_support%403x.png 708w" alt="" class="navbar_logo"/></a><div class="hidden"><nav role="navigation" class="navbar_navmenu w-nav-menu"><div class="navbar_navmenu-inner"><ul role="list" class="navbar_navmenu-links-list w-list-unstyled"><li class="navbar_navmenu-links-list-item"><a href="#" class="navbar_navlink">Text Link</a></li><li class="navbar_navmenu-links-list-item"><a href="#" class="navbar_navlink">Text Link</a></li><li class="navbar_navmenu-links-list-item"><a href="#" class="navbar_navlink">Text Link</a></li></ul></div></nav><div class="navbar_navmenu-button w-nav-button"><div class="w-icon-nav-menu"></div></div></div></div></div></div><main class="main-wrapper"><header class="page-header china-support-page"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-medium w-container"><div class="china-support_header-bg"><div class="header_inner padding-top-large"><h1 class="header_page-heading"><div>RICOH THETA</div><div>欢迎进入支持页面</div></h1></div></div></div></div></header><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-medium w-container"><div class="section-inner"><div class="grid-2-columns"><a data-wf--card--variant="base" href="https://theta-archive.ricoh360.com/support.theta360.com/cn/manual/" class="card w-inline-block"><div class="card_text-wrapper"><h2 class="card_title">使用手册</h2></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66d9581b00d6e3c0685396fe_Manual%20Icon%403x-2.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_image"/></a><a data-wf--card--variant="base" href="https://www.ricoh-imaging.com.cn/china/common.html?type=Maintenance%20of%20the%20network" class="card w-inline-block"><div class="card_text-wrapper"><h2 class="card_title">询问</h2></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/674e50b204a34f6ad5b6b661_faq_icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_image"/></a></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-medium w-container"><a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/677e84b1fae463d24dd64acd_%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA%E6%A2%9D%E6%AC%BE.pdf" target="_blank" class="link-4">保固條款(pdf)<br/></a></div></div></section><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-tiny w-container"><div class="section-inner"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="center" class="section-header w-variant-b4c15389-20cc-815c-ab7b-babbb9cf8165"><h2 class="section-heading">下载</h2></div><div class="app-download_mobile"><div class="app-download_app-name-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66e000ca0c4a57370346856e_icon_app_s.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="app-download_app-icon"/><h3 class="section-subheading">理光景达</h3></div><div class="margin-bottom-tiny text-align-center">专门用于拍摄、查看和传输照片等操作的应用程序。</div><div class="app-download_compatibility-card"><h4 class="heading-style-text">兼容型号</h4><div class="app-download_models-wrapper"><div class="tag">Z1</div><div class="tag">Z1 51GB</div><div class="tag">X</div><div class="tag">SC2 for Business</div><div class="tag">SC2</div><div class="tag">V</div><div class="tag">SC</div><div class="tag">S</div></div></div><div class="app-download_buttons-block"><div class="section-subheader text-align-center"><h4 class="section-subheading">下载应用程序</h4></div><div class="app-download_buttons-columns-wrapper"><div class="app-download_buttons-column"><a href="https://itunes.apple.com/cn/app/id1028324279" target="_blank" class="app-download_buttons-column w-inline-block"><img width="Auto" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 624.00390625px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66fbae770246ae71584d3f60_apple-en.png" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66fbae770246ae71584d3f60_apple-en-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66fbae770246ae71584d3f60_apple-en.png 624w" class="app-download_store-button"/></a></div><div class="app-download_buttons-column"><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/android/s" target="_blank" class="app-download_buttons-column w-inline-block"><img width="Auto" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/67ff4cf1b1950f12d257b782_Android%20App.png" loading="lazy" class="app-download_store-button-copy"/></a></div></div></div><div class="app-download_specs-block"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="app-download_specs-dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="app-download_specs-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div><strong>建议操作环境</strong></div><div class="app-download_specs-dropdown-toggle-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div></div><nav class="app-download_specs-dropdown-content w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>iOS建议操作环境<br/>・iOS 15 - 16.0.2, iPhone 6s 或更新<br/>・iPadOS 15 - 16.0.2, iPad Air2 或更新<br/>・watchOS 4 - 7, Apple Watch (仅限 RICOH THETA S 和 RICOH THETA SC）* 不保证 iPod touch 的操作。<br/><br/>Android建议操作环境<br/>Android OS 9 - 12</p><p>* 并不保证所有设备上均可操作。</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div class="app-download_pc"><div class="app-download_app-name-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/66e000ca0c4a57370346856e_icon_app_s.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="app-download_app-icon"/><h3 class="section-subheading"><strong>理光景达 (计算机应用程序)</strong></h3></div><div class="margin-bottom-medium text-align-center">查看和编辑保存在 PC 上的照片。PC 应用程序允许您更新 THETA 的固件。</div><div class="app-download_pc-buttons-block"><div class="section-subheader text-align-center"><h4 class="section-subheading">在此下载</h4></div><div class="app-download_pc-buttons"><a href="https://support.theta360.com/cn/download/pcapp/windows" class="secondary-button-general w-button">理光景达 for Windows(R)</a><a href="https://support.theta360.com/cn/download/pcapp/macosx" class="secondary-button-general w-button">理光景达 for Mac</a></div></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="app-download_specs-dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="app-download_specs-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div><strong>建议操作环境</strong></div><div class="app-download_specs-dropdown-toggle-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div></div><nav class="app-download_specs-dropdown-content w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-richtext"><p>Windows建议操作环境</p><p>Windows 10 64 位 / Windows 11</p><p>CPU：Intel Core i3(第八代)处理器或更高版本<br/>内存：8 GB RAM或更高<br/>GPU需要兼容OpenGL 4.5或更高版本<br/>5.7K30fps和4K60fps视频播放环境信息在<a href="https://topics.theta360.com/cn/faq/c_04_x/4401/" target="_blank">这里</a>。(RICOH THETA X)<br/>上述电脑可使用的USB端口</p><p>‍</p><p>Mac建议操作环境</p><p>Mac OS 10.15 - 12</p><p>CPU：Intel Core i3(第四代)处理器或更高版本<br/>内存：2 GB RAM或更高<br/>GPU需要兼容OpenGL 4.1或更高版本<br/>5.7K30fps和4K60fps视频播放环境信息在<a href="https://topics.theta360.com/cn/faq/c_04_x/4401/" target="_blank">这里</a>。(RICOH THETA X)<br/>上述电脑可使用的USB端口</p></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-bg-secondary"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-small w-container"><div class="section-inner"><div class="firmware-update_card"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="center" class="section-header w-variant-b4c15389-20cc-815c-ab7b-babbb9cf8165"><h2 class="section-heading">固件更新</h2></div><div class="firmware-update_block"><div class="text-size-small">*通过 PC 查看和编辑应用程序更新固件将自动使其成为最新版本。</div><div>您需要安装 计算机应用程序 以更新 理光景达。</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-medium w-container"><div class="section-inner"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="center" class="section-header w-variant-b4c15389-20cc-815c-ab7b-babbb9cf8165"><h2 class="section-heading">选项 计算机应用</h2></div><div id="w-node-_3c571cbd-f74e-94c0-4aa4-37546156dcd2-0496fc33" class="table-wrapper"><div id="w-node-e716906d-7eb3-b48a-f969-fe9b38b56a38-0496fc33" class="w-layout-layout apps-column wf-layout-layout"><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">应用名称</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-paragraph-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">兼容型号</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-paragraph-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">建议操作环境</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-paragraph-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">下载</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">缝合应用<br/>RICOH THETA Stitcher</div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">THETA Z1<br/>THETA Z1 51GB<br/>THETA X</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">Windows</div><p class="paragraph-14px">Adobe Photoshop Lightroom Classic 11.4.1<br/>Windows 10 64 位 (版本 1903或更多）/ Windows 11※GPU 需要兼容 OpenGL4.1 或更高版本<br/>※DRAM 16GB或更多<br/>※VRAM 4GB或更多</p><div class="cell-text-16px">Mac</div><p class="paragraph-14px">Adobe Photoshop Lightroom Classic 11.4.1<br/>Mac OS 64 位 10.15 - 12※GPU 需要兼容 OpenGL4.1 或更高版本<br/>※DRAM 16GB或更多<br/>※VRAM 4GB或更多</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-links"><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/lrstitch/win" class="download-text-link">for Windows(R)</a><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/lrstitch/macosx" class="download-text-link">for Mac</a></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">文件传输应用程序<br/>RICOH THETA File Transfer</div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">THETA Z1<br/>THETA Z1 51GB<br/>THETA X<br/>THETA V</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">Mac</div><p class="paragraph-14px">Mac OS 10.15 - 12CPU：Intel Core i3(第四代)处理器或更高版本<br/>内存：2 GB RAM或更高<br/>GPU需要兼容OpenGL 4.1或更高版本<br/>上述电脑可使用的USB端口</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-links"><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/ftapp/macosx" class="download-text-link">for Mac</a></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">直播应用软件<br/>Live-streaming app<br/>- RICOH THETA UVC Blender</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">THETA S</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">Windows</div><p class="paragraph-14px">Windows 10 64 bit<br/>- CPU: Intel Core i3(4th generation) processor or higher<br/>- RAM: 2GB or more<br/>- GPU needs to be compatible with OpenGL 4.1 or higher<br/>- USB port that can be used by the above computer</p><div class="cell-text-16px">Mac</div><p class="paragraph-14px">Mac OS 10.15 - 12<br/>- CPU: Intel Core i3(4th generation) processor or higher<br/>- RAM: 2GB or more<br/>- GPU needs to be compatible with OpenGL 4.1 or higher<br/>- USB port that can be used by the above computer</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-cell apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-links"><a href="https://support.theta360.com/ja/download/liveapp/win64" class="download-text-link">for Windows(R)</a><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/liveapp/macosx" class="download-text-link">for Mac</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-medium w-container"><div class="section-inner"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="center" class="section-header w-variant-b4c15389-20cc-815c-ab7b-babbb9cf8165"><h2 class="section-heading">驱动程序（直播）</h2></div><div class="table-wrapper"><div class="apps-column"><div class="apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">兼容型号</div></div></div><div class="apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">下载</div></div></div><div class="blank-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"><div class="cell-text-16px">THETA Z1、THETA X、THETA V</div></div></div><div class="apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2 cell-text-16px"><div class="accordion-contents-4"><div data-w-id="d5033ad1-12e3-521a-bf22-8250e31e632a" class="accordion-small-title-left"><div class="text-block-16px-left-2">实时传送视频流驱动软件 = Windows = RICOH THETA UVC Driver:</div><div class="text-black-18px-4"><div style="display:none" class="hide-icon-2">ー</div><div class="show-icon-2">＋</div></div></div><div style="height:0px" class="accordion-content-panel-4"><div class="text-block-14px-left">请检查您的电脑的操作系统。 即时串流可以在以下操作系统上运行。<br/>* Windows10（version1703）或更高版本<br/>* macOS Sierra（版本10.12.4）或更高版本<br/></div><a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/liveapp4k/win3" class="w-inline-block"><div class="download-text-link text-block-14px-left"><br/></div></a><div class="text-block-12px flex-left">如果在 Windows 10（版本 1703）或稍后版本中实时视频未在 OBS 显示，那么请尝试以下驱动软件。请注意我们不保证驱动软件有效。<br/>点击<a href="https://support.theta360.com/intl/download/liveapp4k/win3">此处</a>(仅64位作业系统)</div></div></div></div></div><div class="bottom-cell"><div class="cell-block-2"></div></div><div class="apps-cell"><div class="cell-block-2 cell-text-16px"><div class="accordion-contents-4"><div data-w-id="d5033ad1-12e3-521a-bf22-8250e31e634a" class="accordion-small-title-left"><div class="text-block-16px-left-2">实时交付视频流库 = Linux = Libuvc for RICOH THETA:</div><div data-w-id="d5033ad1-12e3-521a-bf22-8250e31e634d" class="text-black-18px-4"><div style="display:none" class="hide-icon-2">ー</div><div class="show-icon-2">＋</div></div></div><div style="height:0px" class="accordion-content-panel-4"><p class="text-block-14px-left">请查看以下网站。(THETA Z1, THETA V)<br/><a href="https://github.com/ricohapi/libuvc-theta/tree/theta_uvc">https://github.com/ricohapi/libuvc-theta/tree/theta_uvc<br/></a>注意不能保证此操作适用于所有操作系统。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="_360nav_component_footer"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer footer_container w-container"><div class="footer_china-support"><a href="/" class="footer_logo-link w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/6752e41ca0a0b97bef88f864_Logomark_RICOH360_H_Black.svg" alt="" class="footer_logo"/></a><div class="footer_copyright">© Ricoh Co., Ltd.</div></div></div></div></footer></div><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/js/staging-support-ricoh360.schunk.f2efb3c5440a81cf.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-VK02VJvMib7ytrF5M2joPWNtDQs366FZgEQ5B+Iwnjx0WBnwQXfootyziSYxdrmS" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66062c275f8ba07799eb4c65/js/staging-support-ricoh360.schunk.68b4849227d81ed8.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-qIQ+n3YSkGRNt8Nr+wNfStMT